<http://www.co-ode.org/ontologies/pizza/pizza.owl#VegetarianPizza> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Any pizza that does not have fish topping and does not have meat topping is a VegetarianPizza. Note that instances of this class do not need to have any toppings at all."@en .
<http://www.co-ode.org/ontologies/pizza/pizza.owl#VegetarianPizza> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Vegetarian Pizza"@en .
