<http://www.co-ode.org/ontologies/pizza/pizza.owl#VegetarianPizzaEquivalent1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Vegetarian Pizza1"@en .
<http://www.co-ode.org/ontologies/pizza/pizza.owl#VegetarianPizzaEquivalent2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.co-ode.org/ontologies/pizza/pizza.owl#VegetarianPizzaEquivalent2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An alternative to VegetarianPizzaEquiv1 that does not require a definition of VegetarianTopping. Perhaps more difficult to maintain. Not equivalent to VegetarianPizza"@en .
<http://www.co-ode.org/ontologies/pizza/pizza.owl#VegetarianPizzaEquivalent2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "PizzaVegetarianaEquivalente2"@pt .
