<http://www.co-ode.org/ontologies/pizza/pizza.owl#VegetarianTopping> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://www.co-ode.org/ontologies/pizza/pizza.owl#VegetarianTopping> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An example of a covering axiom. VegetarianTopping is equivalent to the union of all toppings in the given axiom. VegetarianToppings can only be Cheese or Vegetable or....etc."@en .
<http://www.co-ode.org/ontologies/pizza/pizza.owl#VegetarianTopping> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CoberturaVegetariana"@pt .
