<http://www.co-ode.org/ontologies/pizza> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> "An ontology about pizzas and their toppings.\n\nThis is an example ontology that contains all constructs required for the various versions of the Pizza Tutorial run by Manchester University (see http://owl.cs.manchester.ac.uk/publications/talks-and-tutorials/protg-owl-tutorial)."@en .
